" ghpr setup  Welcome                                                                                                    "
"Set up ghpr?                                           ┌ Preview ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"There's no config file yet                             │Setup asks:                                                    │"
"(~/.config/ghpr/config.toml).                          │  • which accounts to use, with a profile for each             │"
"gh is logged in to 2 GitHub accounts (me-work, me).    │  • where each profile applies (directories, git email)        │"
"Without setup, ghpr uses gh's active one, me-work,     │  • whose team review requests to include                      │"
"everywhere.                                            │  • which view to open with                                    │"
"                                                       │  • which accounts are bots                                    │"
"› Set up now                                           │                                                               │"
"  Skip                                                 │Nothing is written until you confirm. Skip writes a short      │"
"                                                       │starter config so this doesn't come up again; `ghpr config     │"
"                                                       │init` runs setup any time.                                     │"
